---A single assigned targeting option, which defines the state of a targeting option for an entity with targeting settings.
---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AssignedTargetingOption
---@field urlDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.UrlAssignedTargetingOptionDetails URL details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_URL`.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name for this assigned targeting option.
---@field inheritance? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AssignedTargetingOptionInheritanceEnum|string Output only. The inheritance status of the assigned targeting option.
---@field viewabilityDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ViewabilityAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Viewability details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_VIEWABILITY`. You can only target one viewability option per resource.
---@field poiDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.PoiAssignedTargetingOptionDetails POI details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_POI`.
---@field contentGenreDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ContentGenreAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content genre details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_GENRE`.
