---@field assignedTargetingOptionId? string Output only. The unique ID of the assigned targeting option. The ID is only unique within a given resource and targeting type. It may be reused in other contexts.
---@field carrierAndIspDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CarrierAndIspAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Carrier and ISP details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CARRIER_AND_ISP`.
---@field thirdPartyVerifierDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ThirdPartyVerifierAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Third party verification details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_THIRD_PARTY_VERIFIER`.
