---@field entityStatus? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CampaignEntityStatusEnum Required. Controls whether or not the insertion orders under this campaign can spend their budgets and bid on inventory. * Accepted values are `ENTITY_STATUS_ACTIVE`, `ENTITY_STATUS_ARCHIVED`, and `ENTITY_STATUS_PAUSED`. * For CreateCampaign method, `ENTITY_STATUS_ARCHIVED` is not allowed.
---@field campaignFlight? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CampaignFlight Required. The planned spend and duration of the campaign.
---@field campaignGoal? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CampaignGoal Required. The goal of the campaign.

---Settings that control how the campaign budget is allocated.
---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CampaignBudget
---@field externalBudgetId? string Immutable. The ID identifying this budget to the external source. If this field is set and the invoice detail level of the corresponding billing profile is set to "Budget level PO", all impressions served against this budget will include this ID on the invoice. Must be unique under the campaign.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the budget. Must be UTF-8 encoded with a maximum size of 240 bytes.
