---@field targetingExpansion? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.TargetingExpansionConfig Optional. The [optimized targeting](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/12060859) settings of the ad group.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the ad group. Must be UTF-8 encoded with a maximum size of 255 bytes.
---@field adGroupId? string Output only. The unique ID of the ad group. Assigned by the system.
---@field bidStrategy? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.BiddingStrategy Optional. The bidding strategy used by the ad group. Only the youtubeAndPartnersBid and demandGenBid field can be used in the bidding strategy.
---@field entityStatus? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AdGroupEntityStatusEnum|string Required. Controls whether or not the ad group can spend its budget and bid on inventory. If the ad group's parent line item is not active, the ad group can't spend its budget even if its own status is `ENTITY_STATUS_ACTIVE`.
