---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CreateAdvertisersCampaignsRequest
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the campaign. Must be UTF-8 encoded with a maximum size of 240 bytes.
---@field updateTime? string Output only. The timestamp when the campaign was last updated. Assigned by the system.
---@field frequencyCap? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.FrequencyCap Required. The frequency cap setting of the campaign. *Warning*: On **February 28, 2025**, frequency cap time periods greater than 30 days will no longer be accepted. [Read more about this announced change](/display-video/api/deprecations#features.lifetime_frequency_cap)
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the campaign.
---@field campaignId? string Output only. The unique ID of the campaign. Assigned by the system.
---@field campaignBudgets? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CampaignBudgetList The list of budgets available to this campaign. If this field is not set, the campaign uses an unlimited budget.
---@field entityStatus? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CampaignEntityStatusEnum|string Required. Controls whether or not the insertion orders under this campaign can spend their budgets and bid on inventory. * Accepted values are `ENTITY_STATUS_ACTIVE`, `ENTITY_STATUS_ARCHIVED`, and `ENTITY_STATUS_PAUSED`. * For CreateCampaign method, `ENTITY_STATUS_ARCHIVED` is not allowed.
---@field campaignFlight? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CampaignFlight Required. The planned spend and duration of the campaign.
---@field campaignGoal? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CampaignGoal Required. The goal of the campaign.
---@field advertiserId string Output only. The unique ID of the advertiser the campaign belongs to.

---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.CreateAdvertisersChannelsRequest
---@field positivelyTargetedLineItemCount? string Output only. Number of line items that are directly targeting this channel positively.
---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the channel.
---@field negativelyTargetedLineItemCount? string Output only. Number of line items that are directly targeting this channel negatively.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the channel. Must be UTF-8 encoded with a maximum length of 240 bytes.
---@field channelId? string Output only. The unique ID of the channel. Assigned by the system.
---@field advertiserId string The ID of the advertiser that owns the created channel.
---@field partnerId? string The ID of the partner that owns the created channel.

