---@field inventorySourceGroupDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.InventorySourceGroupAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Inventory source group details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_INVENTORY_SOURCE_GROUP`.
