---@field deviceMakeModelDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.DeviceMakeModelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Device make and model details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DEVICE_MAKE_MODEL`.
---@field audioContentTypeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AudioContentTypeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Audio content type details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AUDIO_CONTENT_TYPE`.
---@field operatingSystemDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.OperatingSystemAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Operating system details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_OPERATING_SYSTEM`.
---@field omidDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.OmidAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Open Measurement enabled inventory details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_OMID`.
---@field businessChainDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.BusinessChainAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Business chain details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_BUSINESS_CHAIN`.
---@field audienceGroupDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AudienceGroupAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Audience targeting details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AUDIENCE_GROUP`. You can only target one audience group option per resource.
---@field onScreenPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.OnScreenPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails On screen position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_ON_SCREEN_POSITION`.
---@field contentStreamTypeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ContentStreamTypeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content duration details. This field will be populated when the TargetingType is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_STREAM_TYPE`.
---@field youtubeVideoDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.YoutubeVideoAssignedTargetingOptionDetails YouTube video details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_YOUTUBE_VIDEO`.
---@field contentInstreamPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ContentInstreamPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content instream position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_INSTREAM_POSITION`.
---@field contentDurationDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ContentDurationAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content duration details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_DURATION`.
---@field contentThemeExclusionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ContentThemeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content theme details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_THEME_EXCLUSION`. Content theme are targeting exclusions. Advertiser level content theme exclusions, if set, are always applied in serving (even though they aren't visible in resource settings). Resource settings can exclude content theme in addition to advertiser exclusions.
---@field contentOutstreamPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ContentOutstreamPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content outstream position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_OUTSTREAM_POSITION`.
---@field keywordDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.KeywordAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Keyword details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_KEYWORD`. A maximum of 5000 direct negative keywords can be assigned to a resource. No limit on number of positive keywords that can be assigned.
---@field channelDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ChannelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Channel details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CHANNEL`.
---@field ageRangeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AgeRangeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Age range details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AGE_RANGE`.
