---@field browserDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.BrowserAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Browser details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_BROWSER`.
---@field parentalStatusDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ParentalStatusAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Parental status details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_PARENTAL_STATUS`.
---@field regionalLocationListDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.RegionalLocationListAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Regional location list details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_REGIONAL_LOCATION_LIST`.
---@field exchangeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.ExchangeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Exchange details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_EXCHANGE`.
---@field geoRegionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.GeoRegionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Geographic region details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_GEO_REGION`.
---@field dayAndTimeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.DayAndTimeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Day and time details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DAY_AND_TIME`.
---@field digitalContentLabelExclusionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.DigitalContentLabelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Digital content label details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DIGITAL_CONTENT_LABEL_EXCLUSION`. Digital content labels are targeting exclusions. Advertiser level digital content label exclusions, if set, are always applied in serving (even though they aren't visible in resource settings). Resource settings can exclude content labels in addition to advertiser exclusions, but can't override them. A line item won't serve if all the digital content labels are excluded.
