---@field name? string Output only. The resource name of the inventory source group.
---@field partnerId? string The ID of the partner that owns the inventory source group. Only this partner will have write access to this group. Only advertisers to which this group is explicitly shared will have read access to this group.
---@field advertiserId? string The ID of the advertiser that owns the inventory source group. The parent partner will not have access to this group.

