---General settings of a partner.
---@class gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.PartnerGeneralConfig
---@field timeZone? string Immutable. The standard TZ database name of the partner's time zone. For example, `America/New_York`. See more at: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_tz_database_time_zones
