---@field mastheadAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.MastheadAd Output only. Details of an [ad served on the YouTube Home feed](//support.google.com/google-ads/answer/9709826).
---@field inStreamAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.InStreamAd Optional. Details of an [in-stream ad skippable after 5 seconds](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/6274216), used for brand awareness or reach marketing objectives.
---@field videoPerformanceAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.VideoPerformanceAd Optional. Details of an [ad used in a video action campaign](//support.google.com/google-ads/answer/10147229) to drive actions to the business, service or product.
---@field audioAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AudioAd Output only. Details of an [audio ad](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/6274216) used for reach marketing objectives.
---@field demandGenVideoAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.DemandGenVideoAd Optional. Details of a [Demand Gen video ad](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/15598924?&sjid=11207068802760924844-NC#VideoAd).
---@field dcmTrackingInfo? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.DcmTrackingInfo Optional. The DCM tracking ad info. To remove the DCM tracking ad info, please leave this field empty.
---@field adGroupId? string Required. Immutable. The unique ID of the ad group that the ad belongs to.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the ad. Must be UTF-8 encoded with a maximum size of 255 bytes.
---@field nonSkippableAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.NonSkippableAd Optional. Details of a [non-skippable short in-stream video ad](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/6274216), between 6 and 15 seconds, used for reach marketing objectives.
---@field entityStatus? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AdGroupAdEntityStatusEnum|string Required. The entity status of the ad.
---@field bumperAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.BumperAd Optional. Details of a [non-skippable short video ad](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/6274216), equal to or less than 6 seconds, used for reach.
---@field adPolicy? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.AdPolicy Output only. The policy approval status of the ad.
---@field videoDiscoverAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.VideoDiscoveryAd Output only. Details of an [ad promoting a video](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/6274216) that shows in places of discovery.
---@field demandGenProductAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.DemandGenProductAd Optional. Details of a [Demand Gen product ad](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/15598924?&sjid=11207068802760924844-NC#Product-onlyAd).
---@field demandGenCarouselAd? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v3.DemandGenCarouselAd Optional. Details of a [Demand Gen carousel ad](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/15598924?&sjid=11207068802760924844-NC#CarouselAd).
---@field adGroupAdId string Output only. The unique ID of the ad. Assigned by the system.
---@field advertiserId string Output only. The unique ID of the advertiser the ad belongs to.
